{"id":"ea3f18feeaa80989","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-relative-K-conditional.md","title":"Conditional Complexity Characterizes rK Reducibility","display":"thm-relative-K-conditional — Conditional Complexity Characterizes rK Reducibility","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-relative-K-conditional","aliases":["43-thm-relative-K-conditional"],"display":"thm-relative-K-conditional — Conditional Complexity Characterizes rK Reducibility","depends_on":["[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","[[43-df-condkolm]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.7.4 and following observation","source_printed_pages":"362–363","source_pdf_pages":"382–383","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-relative-K-conditional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-relative-K-conditional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-K-conditional — Conditional Complexity Characterizes rK Reducibility"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.7.4 and following observation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"362–363"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"382–383"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 见相应定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1ec9f1619fc70e88\" href=\"?note=1ec9f1619fc70e88\" title=\"43-df-relative-K-red\">43-df-relative-K-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(B\\upharpoonright n\\mid A\\upharpoonright n)\\le c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(B\\upharpoonright n\\mid A\\upharpoonright n)\\le c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(B\\upharpoonright n\\mid A\\upharpoonright n)\\le d\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(B\\le_{\\mathrm{rK}}A\\right)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(B\\upharpoonright n\\mid A\\upharpoonright n)\\le d\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有界候选分支可用固定长度程序编码；反过来枚举所有常数长度以内的程序得到有限候选数。普通和前缀条件复杂度为常数界时等价。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.7.4 and following observation；印刷页 362–363，PDF 页 382–383。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1619fc70e88","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-relative-K-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condkolm","status":"resolved","id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-relative-K-red","status":"resolved","id":"1ec9f1